cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use sievesafe, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "sievesafe: zero-shot title/abstract screening that auto-excludes only below a pre-specified threshold"
abstract: >-
  Title/abstract screening for systematic reviews with a zero-shot probabilistic model (TypeSafe Jev) and a exclusion
  threshold fixed before evaluation, developed on SYNERGY+ and tested with pre-specified plans on CLEF TAR.
authors:
